# Line-ending policy. This repo is edited on Windows but its shell scripts run on
# Linux (sol1) and are piped through adb; a CRLF shebang gives "bad interpreter".
# core.autocrlf is on for this clone -- without the rule below, run_cell.sh,
# campaign.sh, soak.sh and pilot_tssdnet.sh would check out with CRLF.
*.sh text eol=lf

# .ps1 files in this project carry a UTF-8 BOM and are required to stay
# ASCII-only (2026-07-25: a CP1252-decoded em-dash closed a string early and
# broke pilot_tssdnet.ps1 under PowerShell 5.1). Exclude them from any
# normalisation so nothing rewrites them behind our back.
*.ps1 -text
